{"id":48,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا فَتَحْنَا لَكَ فَتْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">حًا م</span>ُّبِينًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"لِّيَغْفِرَ لَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مَا تَقَدَّمَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نۢب</span>ِكَ وَمَا تَأَخَّرَ وَيُتِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ نِعْمَتَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> عَلَيْكَ وَيَهْدِيَكَ صِر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">طًا م</span>ُّسْتَقِيمًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نص</span>ُرَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ نَصْرًا عَزِيزًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّكِينَةَ فِى قُلُوبِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنِينَ لِيَزْدَاد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> إِيمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا م</span>َّعَ إِيمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نِهِمْ‌ۗ وَلِلَّهِ جُنُودُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۚ وَكَانَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلِيمًا حَكِيمًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"لِّيُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>خِلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَ<