mal\">َٰ</span>لُنَا وَأَهْلُونَا فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَغْفِرْ لَنَا‌ۚ يَقُولُونَ بِأَلْسِنَتِه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ِم م</span>َّا لَيْسَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمْ‌ۚ قُلْ فَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َمْلِكُ لَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ شَيْــًٔا إِنْ أَرَادَ بِكُمْ ضَرًّا أَوْ أَرَادَ بِكُمْ نَفْع<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">َۢا‌ۚ ب</span>َلْ كَانَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرَۢا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١١</span>"},{"id":12,"tajweed":"بَلْ ظَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">َن ل</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نق</span>َلِبَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّسُولُ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنُونَ إِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَهْلِيهِمْ أَبَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا و</span>َزُيِّنَ ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ فِى قُلُوبِكُمْ وَظَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ ظَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّوْءِ وَكُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُمْ قَوْم<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">َۢا ب</span>ُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٢</span>"},{"id":13,"tajweed":"وَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">َن ل</span>َّمْ يُؤْم<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>ِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَرَسُولِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَعْتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>نَا لِلْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>فِرِينَ سَعِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٣</span>"},{"id":14,"tajweed":"وَلِلَّهِ مُلْكُ <span