nd\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"سُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َةَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّتِى قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> خَلَتْ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُ‌ۖ وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َجِدَ لِسُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َةِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دِيلاً <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى كَفَّ أَيْدِيَهُمْ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>ُمْ وَأَيْدِيَكُمْ عَنْه<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِبَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">طْ</span>نِ مَكَّةَ م<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>َعْدِ أَنْ أَظْفَرَكُمْ عَلَيْهِمْ‌ۚ وَكَانَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"هُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَصَدُّوكُمْ عَنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَسْجِدِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَرَامِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْهَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>ىَ مَعْكُوفًا أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُغَ مَحِلَّهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span>‌ۚ وَلَوْلَا رِجَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ م</span>ُّؤْمِنُونَ وَنِس<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ءٌ م</span>ُّؤْمِنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">تٌ ل</span>َّمْ تَعْلَمُوهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َطَــُٔوهُمْ فَتُصِيبَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنْه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّعَرَّ<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ةُۢ ب<